       <button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white font-medium hover:bg-indigo-500 transition\">Start Free Trial</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">Enterprise</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6\">Dedicated deployment &amp; SLA.</p>\n          <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6\">Custom</div>\n          <button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-white font-medium hover:bg-slate-700 transition\">Contact Sales</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"border-t border-slate-900 bg-slate-950 py-12 text-slate-500 text-sm text-center\">\n    <p>&copy; 2026 NexusAI. Built with modern web standards.</p>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    lucide.createIcons();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
